+	"*[emphasized link](https://e.f)* and https://auto.link/{w}\n",
+	"- [ ] task {w}\n",
+	"- [x] done {w}\n\n",
+	"$x^{w}$ and \\(y\\)\n",
+	"trailing spaces  \n",
+	"日本語のテキスト {w} 😀 naïve\n",
